WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.669
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:05.838
And now we are going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.174
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell yesterday

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.744
called President Biden's speech
in Georgia on voting rights,

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:14.080
quote, "profoundly
unpresidential."

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.917
Oh, I'm sorry -- is that
something we still track?

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:22.422
What should he have said?
Voting is only for 9s and above?

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.223
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:27.726
has reportedly found a loophole
that will allow Democrats

00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:29.562
to bypass
a Republican filibuster

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.231
on a new voting rights bill.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.732
All he had to do to find it

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.035
was push his glasses up
to their normal height.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:39.205
"Oh! There it is!"

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.541
Confidants of former
Vice President Mike Pence

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.576
reportedly believe
that he is preparing

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.411
to run for president in 2024,

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:49.582
though I think he's just in it
for the security detail.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.585
Amid accusations of nepotism,
it was announced yesterday

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:56.088
that New York Mayor Eric Adams
has demoted his brother

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:57.590
from deputy police commissioner

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.259
to executive director
of mayoral security.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:02.762
Still not as bad
as when Mayor Giuliani

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:07.433
gave his cousin the job of wife.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.068
During a speech --
Sometimes you're bummed

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.571
that there's not
an audience around.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.906
During a speech yesterday
on the Senate floor,

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.408
Republican Senator Marco Rubio

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.843
described the life
of a typical liberal

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:21.180
as watching MSNBC,
morning Peloton bike rides,

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.517
drinking caramel macchiatos,
and eating avocado toast.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.686
Are you kidding me?

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:29.555
Do you know how many calories
are in a caramel macchiato?

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:33.892
I'm not gonna throw away
my Peloton ride like that.

00:01:33.892 --> 00:01:36.562
Supreme Court heard
oral arguments on Tuesday,

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:38.865
and Justice Neil Gorsuch
was reportedly

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.700
the only member
not to wear a face mask.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:44.670
Even worse, they're letting him
play in the Australian Open.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.173
An ex-girlfriend of Republican
congressman Matt Gaetz

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:50.376
reportedly testified yesterday
before a federal grand jury.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.712
After being thanked
for cooperating, she said,

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.382
"Hey, anything to get out
of gym class."

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:59.718
Organizers of the annual
Toy Fair New York trade show

00:01:59.718 --> 00:02:01.887
canceled the event this week
for the second year in a row

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:03.489
amid a rise
in coronavirus cases,

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:06.759
which is for the best because
they were about to launch

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.428
the new Cough on Me Elmo.

00:02:09.428 --> 00:02:11.264
Three men were arrested
in New York recently

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.633
after they allegedly
impersonated police officers

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.801
to rob a suspected drug dealer

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:18.804
of more than $150,000
and 3 kilograms of cocaine.

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:22.809
Even crazier, the suspected
drug dealer who called the cops.

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:26.311
"Yeah, I'd like to report
a robbery of some, uh...

00:02:26.311 --> 00:02:28.814
various items."

00:02:28.814 --> 00:02:32.151
Actress Megan Fox
and musician Machine Gun Kelly

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:33.819
announced their engagement
yesterday

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:35.822
and said they drank
each other's blood.

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.656
That's right --
he got down on one knee,

00:02:37.656 --> 00:02:38.892
then two knees,

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:41.227
then passed out from blood loss.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:42.895
And finally,
according to a new study,

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:44.897
exercising for 20 minutes a day

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.066
can reduce the risk
of developing dementia.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:50.903
Finally, conclusive evidence
that golf is not exercise.

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:53.106
And that was a monologue.

